		   If a password with the same scope and username exists in both the current upm instance and the backup archive, the user will be prompted whether to keep the current password, or overwrite with the archived version.
		   It is strongly recommended to create a backup of the current upm instance with the 'backup' command before attempting a merger."
	    ;;
        "usage_examples")
	    printf '%s' \
		   "upm merge ./upm_backup.tar.bz2"
	    ;;
    esac
